(the "Sibling Corpus") as scholarly references in support of the
azimuth and turning-angle identities on which the paper's residual
derivation and safety heuristics rest.

The Sibling Corpus is independent of this Work, licensed separately
under the BSD-3-Clause licence, and governed exclusively by the terms
of that licence.  Nothing in this LICENSE file is intended to extend
the proprietary terms of this Work to the Sibling Corpus, nor to
restrict the freedoms that BSD-3-Clause grants to users of the Sibling
Corpus.

