  1. The theorem statements, function signatures, and other identifying
     excerpts of the Sibling Corpus that the paper reproduces under
     permission 2 (SCHOLARLY CITATION) of this LICENSE remain governed
     by the BSD-3-Clause licence of the Sibling Corpus.  Reproduction
     under this LICENSE is an additional permission for the paper's
     proprietary context, not a substitution of governing licence for
     the underlying material.

  2. Readers of the paper who wish to use, copy, modify, redistribute,
     or build upon the Sibling Corpus itself should consult the
     LICENSE file of that repository.  No permission to do any of those
     things is granted by, or required from, this LICENSE.

  3. The "NO USE FOR TRAINING OF AI / MACHINE-LEARNING SYSTEMS"
     reservation above applies to this Work only.  It does not extend
     to the Sibling Corpus, whose AI / ML usage is governed by the
     terms of the BSD-3-Clause licence and any reservations the
     Sibling Corpus itself makes.

  4. Scholarly analysis of the citation relationship between the paper
     and the Sibling Corpus -- including comparing the paper's
     proprietary argument to the Sibling Corpus's BSD-licensed
